{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04423","headline":"西还至散关答乔补阙知之 · 陈子昂","name":"西还至散关答乔补阙知之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"葳蕤苍梧凤，嘹唳白露蝉。\n羽翰本非匹，结交何独全。\n昔君事胡马，余得奉戎旃。\n携手向沙塞，关河缅幽燕。\n芳岁几阳止，白日屡徂迁。\n功业云台薄，平生玉佩捐。\n叹此南归日，犹闻北戍边。\n代水不可涉，巴江亦潺湲。\n揽衣度函谷，衔涕望秦川。\n蜀门自兹始，云山方浩然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}